        <briefdescription>
<para>HTTP status codes returned as the first CALLBACK_ argument. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enumerators mirror standard HTTP codes, grouped below by class: 1xx informational, 2xx success, 3xx redirection, 4xx client error and 5xx server error. INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR and SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE are the two values produced by statusForException. <simplesect kind="note"><para>Only codes used by this server are listed; getDescription falls back to a generic string for values outside this set. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
